    "Quan he suy tu hinh hoc bbox bang ham thuoc co tham so; in_front_of va behind do tin cay thap, nen gan trong so thap.",
    "Tap nen nay la ban de xuat, can rut gon sau buoc kiem thu tren mau 100 video."
